#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:5
msgid "Video"
msgstr "视频"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:7
msgid ""
"This guide covers video generation through AIBrix's gateway. It walks "
"through deploying a vLLM-Omni video generation model — `Wan-"
"AI/Wan2.1-VACE-1.3B-diffusers <https://huggingface.co/Wan-"
"AI/Wan2.1-VACE-1.3B-diffusers>`_ — and driving it through the gateway, "
"both synchronously and as an async job you poll and download. The Videos "
"API is the video endpoint family vLLM-Omni documents; see the "
":ref:`supported endpoints <multimodal-supported-endpoints>`. Before you "
"start, finish the :ref:`prerequisites <omni-prerequisites>` and "
":ref:`gateway access <omni-access-gateway>` steps on the Multi-Modal "
"Serving page, which set up the cluster and the ``$BASE`` used below."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍通过 AIBrix 网关生成视频。内容包括部署 vLLM-Omni 视频生成模型 `Wan-AI/Wan2.1-VACE-1.3B-"
"diffusers <https://huggingface.co/Wan-AI/Wan2.1-VACE-1.3B-diffusers>`_ "
"，并通过网关调用：既支持同步生成，也支持异步任务轮询与下载。Videos API 是 vLLM-Omni 文档中列出的视频端点族；参见 "
":ref:`支持的端点 <multimodal-supported-endpoints>` 。开始之前，请先完成多模态服务页面上的 "
":ref:`前置条件 <omni-prerequisites>` 和 :ref:`访问网关 <omni-access-gateway>` "
"步骤，它们会准备好集群以及下文使用的 ``$BASE`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:10
msgid ""
"The sample manifest referenced in this guide lives at "
"`samples/vllm_omni/wan2.1-vace-1.3b.yaml <https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/blob/main/samples/vllm_omni/wan2.1-vace-1.3b.yaml>`_ in "
"the AIBrix repository."
msgstr ""
"本指南引用的示例清单位于 AIBrix 仓库的 `samples/vllm_omni/wan2.1-vace-1.3b.yaml "
"<https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/blob/main/samples/vllm_omni/wan2.1-vace-1.3b.yaml>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:15
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The stock gateway already matches ``/v1/videos`` on its own reserved "
"HTTPRoutes (so requests reach ext_proc before a ``model`` header exists) "
"and uses 600s Envoy / ext_proc / model-HTTPRoute timeouts so synchronous "
"generation can finish. The Videos API gets routes of its own — ``aibrix-"
"reserved-router-videos`` for the JSON endpoints and ``aibrix-reserved-"
"router-videos-streaming`` for ``/v1/videos/sync`` and "
"``/v1/videos/{id}/content`` — because those two groups need opposite "
"ext_proc response-body modes; see the troubleshooting note on truncated "
"responses below. If you installed an older AIBrix release, apply both "
"routes with their ``EnvoyExtensionPolicy`` objects (``config/gateway"
"/gateway-plugin``) and set ``AIBRIX_GATEWAY_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=600`` on the "
"controller-manager."
msgstr ""
"默认网关已经用自带的保留 HTTPRoute 匹配 ``/v1/videos``（因此请求在尚无 ``model`` 头时就能到达 "
"ext_proc），并把 Envoy / ext_proc / 模型 HTTPRoute 超时设为 600s，以便同步生成能够完成。Videos "
"API 有自己的路由——JSON 端点用 ``aibrix-reserved-router-"
"videos``，``/v1/videos/sync`` 和 ``/v1/videos/{id}/content`` 用 ``aibrix-"
"reserved-router-videos-streaming``——因为这两组需要相反的 ext_proc "
"响应体模式；见下方关于截断响应的故障排查说明。若安装的是较旧的 AIBrix 版本，请同时应用这两条路由及其 "
"``EnvoyExtensionPolicy``（``config/gateway/gateway-plugin``），并在 "
"controller-manager 上设置 ``AIBRIX_GATEWAY_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=600``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:19
msgid ""
"Video generation needs a bit more from the gateway than a stateless chat "
"completion does. Because a generated video is written to local disk on "
"whichever pod created it, the gateway has to remember which pod owns each"
" job and route follow-up calls back to that exact pod. It does so through"
" an asynchronous-job registry: on a successful create it mints its own "
"opaque **public job ID** and hands that to the client instead of the "
"engine's ID, keeping the backend ID and the owning pod's identity to "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"视频生成对网关的要求比无状态 chat completion 更高。生成的视频写在创建它的那个 Pod "
"的本地磁盘上，因此网关必须记住每个任务属于哪个 Pod，并把后续调用路由回该 "
"Pod。它通过异步任务登记表实现：创建成功时签发自己的不透明**公开任务 ID** 交给客户端，而不是引擎 ID，后端 ID 和所属 Pod "
"身份只保留在网关内部。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:40
msgid ""
"Records are read from and written to Redis on every operation — there is "
"no per-replica job cache and so no reconciliation window: any replica can"
" serve a follow-up for a job another replica created. Without Redis "
"(local development, a single replica) the registry falls back to process-"
"local storage, and jobs are lost when that replica restarts."
msgstr ""
"每项操作都从 Redis 读写记录——没有按副本的任务缓存，因此也没有对账窗口：任何副本都可以为另一个副本创建的任务提供后续调用。没有 Redis"
" 时（本地开发、单副本）登记表回退到进程内存储，该副本重启后任务会丢失。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:42
msgid ""
"Each record is owner-scoped. The owner is derived from the request's "
"``user`` header (``scope:user:<name>``); requests without one share "
"``scope:shared``. A bearer token is not an identity: it authenticates the"
" request but never names a principal. ``GET``/``DELETE`` and the catalog "
"require an exact scope match, and ``scope:shared`` is not a wildcard — so"
" a missing job and someone else's job are both an indistinguishable "
"``404``."
msgstr ""
"每条记录都有所有者作用域。所有者来自请求的 ``user`` 头（``scope:user:<name>``）；没有该头的请求共享 "
"``scope:shared``。Bearer token 不是身份：它认证请求，但从不命名主体。``GET``/``DELETE`` "
"和目录要求精确的作用域匹配，``scope:shared`` 不是通配符——因此缺失的任务和别人的任务都是无法区分的 ``404``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:44
msgid ""
"Resolution also verifies the recorded pod's UID against the informer "
"cache. If the pod is gone, terminating, or has been recreated under a new"
" UID, the job it held is unrecoverable: the record is dropped and the "
"call returns ``404``. A pod that is merely NotReady, or has no routable "
"address yet, keeps its record and returns a retryable ``503``."
msgstr ""
"解析时还会用 informer 缓存核对所记录 Pod 的 UID。若 Pod 已消失、正在终止，或已用新 UID "
"重建，它持有的任务不可恢复：记录被丢弃，调用返回 ``404``。仅仅 NotReady 或尚无路由地址的 Pod 会保留记录并返回可重试的 "
"``503``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:46
msgid ""
"Records expire with the backend's own ``expires_at`` when the create "
"response provides one, and after 7 days otherwise — a backend expiry is "
"honoured as given, never stretched to the default, so a create whose "
"``expires_at`` has already passed is refused with ``503`` rather than "
"registered for a week. Expired records are absent from both lookups and "
"the catalog."
msgstr ""
"若创建响应提供了后端自己的 ``expires_at``，记录按该时间过期，否则 7 "
"天后过期——后端过期时间按原样遵守，绝不会被拉长到默认值，因此 ``expires_at`` 已经过去的创建会以 ``503`` "
"拒绝，而不是登记一周。过期记录在查找和目录中都不出现。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:48
msgid ""
"``POST /v1/videos/sync`` doesn't need any of this: it's a single "
"request/response, so ordinary model-based routing is enough."
msgstr "``POST /v1/videos/sync`` 不需要这些：它是单次请求/响应，因此普通的按模型路由就足够了。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:55
msgid "Step 1 — Deploy the Video Generation Model"
msgstr "步骤 1 — 部署视频生成模型"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:57
msgid "One GPU is enough for the 1.3B-parameter Wan model used here."
msgstr "这里使用的 13 亿参数 Wan 模型，一块 GPU 就足够。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:62
msgid ""
"Apply it and wait for the pod to become ready. The model is loaded from "
"the host path ``/data00/models/Wan2.1-VACE-1.3B-diffusers`` (mounted at "
"``/models``), so the weights must already be present on the node:"
msgstr ""
"应用清单并等待 Pod 就绪。模型从主机路径 ``/data00/models/Wan2.1-VACE-1.3B-diffusers`` "
"加载（挂载到 ``/models`` ），因此权重必须已存在于该节点："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:70
msgid ""
"To serve a different vLLM-Omni model (a different video model, or an "
"image/audio one like ``qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml``), swap the container's "
"``vllm serve <model>`` argument, ``--served-model-name``, and the "
"``model.aibrix.ai/name``/Service name — the request shape stays the same "
"as long as the model belongs to the same task family. See vLLM-Omni's "
"`supported models list <https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/vllm-"
"omni/en/stable/>`_."
msgstr ""
"若要服务其他 vLLM-Omni 模型（其他视频模型，或 ``qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml`` 这类图像/音频模型），替换容器的 "
"``vllm serve <model>`` 参数、``--served-model-name`` ，以及 "
"``model.aibrix.ai/name``/Service 名称。只要模型属于同一任务族，请求形态保持不变。参见 vLLM-Omni 的 "
"`支持模型列表 <https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/vllm-omni/en/stable/>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:75
msgid "Step 2 — Generate a Video Synchronously"
msgstr "步骤 2 — 同步生成视频"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:77
msgid ""
"``POST /v1/videos/sync`` blocks until generation completes and returns "
"the raw MP4 bytes directly. Both video endpoints take ``multipart/form-"
"data`` — do **not** set ``-H \"Content-Type: application/json\"``."
msgstr ""
"``POST /v1/videos/sync`` 会阻塞直到生成完成，并直接返回原始 MP4 字节。两个视频接口均接受 ``multipart"
"/form-data``——**不要** 设置 ``-H \"Content-Type: application/json\"`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:97
msgid ""
"**Image-to-video**: VACE also supports using a reference image as the "
"starting frame — pass it via ``input_reference``:"
msgstr "**图生视频** ：VACE 也支持将参考图像作为起始帧——通过 ``input_reference`` 传入："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:114
msgid "Step 3 — Generate a Video Asynchronously"
msgstr "步骤 3 — 异步生成视频"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:116
msgid ""
"For longer generations, ``POST /v1/videos`` returns immediately with a "
"job ID while generation continues in the background — poll for status and"
" fetch the result once it's done. The ID you get back is the gateway's "
"own opaque public job ID (``aibrixjob-...``), not the engine's; use it "
"everywhere below."
msgstr ""
"对于较长的生成，``POST /v1/videos`` 立即返回任务 ID，生成在后台继续——轮询状态，完成后获取结果。你拿到的 ID "
"是网关自己的不透明公开任务 ID（``aibrixjob-...``），不是引擎的；下面各处都使用它。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:118
msgid "**Submit the job:**"
msgstr "**提交任务：**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:139
msgid ""
"The ``user`` header is what scopes the job: every follow-up call below "
"must send the same value, or the gateway will answer ``404`` — a job "
"belonging to another scope is indistinguishable from one that does not "
"exist. Omit it consistently and the job lands in the shared scope "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"``user`` 头决定任务作用域：下面每次后续调用都必须发送相同的值，否则网关会返回 "
"``404``——属于其他作用域的任务与不存在的任务无法区分。始终省略该头，则任务进入共享作用域。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:141
msgid ""
"The raw response (before extracting ``.id``) looks like this — note that "
"``id`` is the gateway's public job ID, substituted for the engine's. The "
"same shape is returned by the poll step below, with ``status``, "
"``progress``, and ``completed_at`` updated as generation proceeds:"
msgstr ""
"提取 ``.id`` 之前的原始响应如下——注意 ``id`` 是网关的公开任务 ID，已替换引擎 "
"ID。下方轮询步骤返回同样的形状，并随着生成推进更新 ``status``、``progress`` 和 ``completed_at``："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:168
msgid ""
"**Poll status** until it reports ``completed`` or ``failed``. The gateway"
" resolves the public ID and transparently pins the request to the pod "
"that created the job, regardless of which pod would normally be picked by"
" its routing policy:"
msgstr ""
"**轮询状态**，直到报告 ``completed`` 或 ``failed``。网关解析公开 ID，并透明地把请求钉到创建该任务的 "
"Pod，无论其路由策略通常会选哪个 Pod："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:174
msgid "**Download the result** once ``completed``:"
msgstr "状态为 ``completed`` 后**下载结果** ："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:180
msgid ""
"**List your jobs** instead of polling one by ID. This is the gateway's "
"own catalog for your scope, so no ``model`` parameter is needed. It "
"follows the OpenAI Videos cursor shape: ``limit`` is 1--100 (default 20),"
" ``order`` is ``asc`` or ``desc`` (default ``desc``), and ``after`` is "
"the ``last_id`` from the previous page:"
msgstr ""
"**列出你的任务**，而不是按 ID 轮询某一个。这是网关为你的作用域维护的目录，因此不需要 ``model`` 参数。它遵循 OpenAI "
"Videos 游标形状：``limit`` 为 1--100（默认 20），``order`` 为 ``asc`` 或 ``desc``（默认 "
"``desc``），``after`` 是上一页的 ``last_id``："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:182
msgid ""
"The ``after`` value is a live catalog cursor: the referenced job must "
"still exist in the same owner scope. If that job is deleted or expires "
"before the next page is requested, the gateway returns ``400 invalid "
"video list cursor or parameters``. Restart the listing without ``after``;"
" a public job ID intentionally contains no creation timestamp from which "
"the deleted position could be recovered."
msgstr ""
"``after`` 值是活动的目录游标：被引用的任务必须仍存在于同一所有者作用域。若该任务在请求下一页之前被删除或过期，网关返回 ``400 "
"invalid video list cursor or parameters``。去掉 ``after`` 重新开始列举；公开任务 ID "
"有意不包含创建时间戳，因此无法从中恢复已删除位置。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:210
msgid ""
"The catalog reports what the gateway knows: the job's identity, model, "
"and retention window. It does not call the backend, so it carries no live"
" ``status`` or ``progress`` — poll the job by ID for those. Video "
"endpoint paths are exact; ``/v1/videos/`` and other trailing-slash "
"variants return ``404``."
msgstr ""
"目录报告网关所知道的内容：任务身份、模型和保留窗口。它不调用后端，因此没有实时 ``status`` 或 ``progress``——按 ID "
"轮询任务以获取这些。视频端点路径是精确匹配的；``/v1/videos/`` 及其他带尾斜杠的变体返回 ``404``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:212
msgid ""
"**Delete a job** once you no longer need it. The record is removed once "
"the backend confirms the delete (``2xx``) or reports it already gone "
"(``404``); a backend ``5xx`` leaves the record in place so you can retry:"
msgstr ""
"**删除任务** （不再需要时）。后端确认删除（``2xx`` ）或报告已经不存在（``404`` ）后，记录才会被移除；后端 ``5xx`` "
"会保留记录以便重试："

