#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:233
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:239
msgid "POST"
msgstr "POST"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:234
msgid ""
"Create an async video generation job. Returns a public job ID "
"immediately, registered against the pod that created it. If the job "
"cannot be registered, the call fails with ``503`` and no ID is handed "
"out."
msgstr "创建异步视频生成任务。立即返回一个公开任务 ID，并登记到创建它的 Pod。若无法登记，调用失败并返回 ``503``，不会下发 ID。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:236
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:242
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:245
msgid "GET"
msgstr "GET"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:237
msgid ""
"List your own jobs from the gateway's registry. Supports OpenAI-style "
"``after``, ``limit`` (1--100), and ``order`` (``asc``/``desc``); never "
"calls a backend. A deleted or expired ``after`` cursor returns 400, and "
"the client must restart from the first page."
msgstr ""
"从网关自己的登记表列出你的任务。支持 OpenAI 风格的 ``after``、``limit``（1--100）和 "
"``order``（``asc``/``desc``）；不会调用后端。已删除或过期的 ``after`` 游标返回 "
"400，客户端必须从第一页重新开始。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:238
msgid "``/v1/videos/sync``"
msgstr "``/v1/videos/sync``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:240
msgid ""
"Create a job and block until it completes; returns the video bytes "
"directly. Not registered — there is no follow-up call to route."
msgstr "创建任务并阻塞直到完成；直接返回视频字节。不登记——没有需要路由的后续调用。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:241
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:247
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``/v1/videos/{id}``"
msgstr "``/v1/videos/{id}``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:243
msgid ""
"Poll a job's status. Pinned to the pod that created it; the response "
"``id`` is the public one."
msgstr "轮询任务状态。钉到创建它的 Pod；响应中的 ``id`` 是公开 ID。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:244
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``/v1/videos/{id}/content``"
msgstr "``/v1/videos/{id}/content``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:246
msgid ""
"Download the completed video. Pinned to the pod that created it; the body"
" streams through unbuffered."
msgstr "下载已完成的视频。钉到创建它的 Pod；响应体不缓冲地流式转发。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:248
msgid "DELETE"
msgstr "DELETE"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:249
msgid ""
"Delete a job and its stored video. Pinned to the pod that created it; the"
" record is removed after a 2xx or 404 response so a failed delete can "
"still be retried."
msgstr "删除任务及其存储的视频。钉到创建它的 Pod；在 2xx 或 404 响应后移除记录，以便失败的删除仍可重试。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:254
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:256
msgid "**``GET``/``DELETE`` on a job ID returns 404**"
msgstr "**对任务 ID 的 ``GET``/``DELETE`` 返回 404**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:258
msgid ""
"The ID is unknown to the gateway, has passed its retention window, "
"belongs to a different ``user`` scope than the one on this request, or "
"its owning pod is gone (deleted, terminating, or recreated under a new "
"UID). Once a pod is gone, the video it generated is gone with it — "
"resubmit the job. Note that \"not yours\" and \"does not exist\" are "
"deliberately the same answer, so check the ``user`` header before "
"assuming the job expired. The response also carries ``x-error-video-not-"
"found: true``."
msgstr ""
"该 ID 对网关未知、已过保留窗口、属于与本请求不同的 ``user`` 作用域，或其所属 Pod 已不存在（已删除、正在终止，或已用新 UID "
"重建）。Pod 一旦消失，它生成的视频也随之消失——请重新提交任务。注意“不是你的”和“不存在”有意是同一个答案，因此在假设任务过期之前先检查 "
"``user`` 头。响应还会带上 ``x-error-video-not-found: true``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:260
msgid "**``GET``/``DELETE`` on a job ID returns 503**"
msgstr "**对任务 ID 的 ``GET``/``DELETE`` 返回 503**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:262
msgid ""
"Either the owning pod is temporarily unroutable (NotReady, or no address "
"yet) or the registry's store is unreachable. Both are retryable and the "
"record is kept: retry the call. A ``503`` from ``POST /v1/videos`` means "
"the job could not be registered — the backend may have started work that "
"is now unreachable, so resubmit. An unroutable owning pod also sets ``x"
"-error-video-job-pod-unavailable: true``; an unreachable store uses ``x"
"-error-routing`` instead."
msgstr ""
"要么所属 Pod 暂时不可路由（NotReady，或尚无地址），要么登记表存储不可达。两者都可重试且记录会保留：请重试调用。``POST "
"/v1/videos`` 返回 ``503`` 表示任务无法登记——后端可能已开始工作但现已不可达，因此请重新提交。不可路由的所属 Pod "
"还会设置 ``x-error-video-job-pod-unavailable: true``；不可达的存储则使用 ``x-error-"
"routing``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:264
msgid "**``POST /v1/videos/sync`` returns 504 / ext_proc timeout**"
msgstr "**``POST /v1/videos/sync`` 返回 504 / ext_proc 超时**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:266
msgid ""
"Synchronous generation can take several minutes. Current AIBrix defaults "
"are 600s for every reserved router's ext_proc ``messageTimeout`` "
"(including the two Videos routes), the ORIGINAL_DST route, and model "
"HTTPRoutes (``AIBRIX_GATEWAY_TIMEOUT_SECONDS``). Older installs used "
"60s/120s and will abort first; raise those three timeouts to at least "
"600s."
msgstr ""
"同步生成可能需要数分钟。当前 AIBrix 默认把每条保留路由的 ext_proc ``messageTimeout``（包括两条 Videos "
"路由）、ORIGINAL_DST 路由和模型 HTTPRoute（``AIBRIX_GATEWAY_TIMEOUT_SECONDS``）都设为 "
"600s。旧安装使用 60s/120s，会先超时；请把这三项超时提高到至少 600s。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:268
msgid "**``GET /v1/videos`` returns fewer jobs than expected**"
msgstr "**``GET /v1/videos`` 返回的任务比预期少**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:270
msgid ""
"The catalog is scoped to the request's ``user`` header, so jobs submitted"
" under a different value (or with no header at all) are not listed. It "
"also lists nothing the gateway did not register: jobs created directly "
"against a pod, and jobs whose retention window has passed, are absent."
msgstr ""
"目录以请求的 ``user`` 头为作用域，因此以不同值（或完全没有该头）提交的任务不会被列出。网关未登记的内容也不会出现：直接打到某个 Pod "
"创建的任务，以及已过保留窗口的任务，都不会列出。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:272
msgid "**Job created on one gateway replica can't be found via another**"
msgstr "**在一个网关副本上创建的任务无法通过另一个副本找到**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:274
msgid ""
"Cross-replica lookup relies on AIBrix's gateway being configured with "
"Redis. Without it the registry is process-local, so the job only exists "
"in the replica that handled the ``POST /v1/videos`` call — and is lost if"
" that replica restarts."
msgstr ""
"跨副本查找依赖为 AIBrix 网关配置 Redis。没有 Redis 时登记表是进程本地的，因此任务只存在于处理 ``POST "
"/v1/videos`` 的那个副本——该副本重启后任务会丢失。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:276
msgid "**Video job responses arrive truncated or the client hangs**"
msgstr "**视频任务响应被截断或客户端挂起**"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:278
msgid ""
"The gateway rewrites the job ID inside the create and status responses, "
"so those two bodies leave ext_proc at a different length than they "
"arrived. It waits for the whole body, rewrites it, and drops the upstream"
" ``content-length`` so Envoy re-derives it. That depends on the Videos "
"JSON endpoints riding their own route, ``aibrix-reserved-router-videos``,"
" whose ``EnvoyExtensionPolicy`` sets "
"``spec.extProc[].processingMode.response.body: Buffered``. An install "
"that removed response-body processing, or that restores ``content-"
"length`` in a later filter, will truncate the rewritten body."
msgstr ""
"网关会改写创建和状态响应中的任务 ID，因此这两个响应体离开 ext_proc 时的长度与到达时不同。它等待完整正文、改写，并丢弃上游 "
"``content-length``，以便 Envoy 重新计算。这依赖于 Videos JSON 端点走自己的路由 ``aibrix-"
"reserved-router-videos``，其 ``EnvoyExtensionPolicy`` 设置 "
"``spec.extProc[].processingMode.response.body: "
"Buffered``。若安装去掉了响应体处理，或在后续过滤器中恢复 ``content-length``，改写后的正文会被截断。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:280
msgid ""
"Buffered is what makes the create guarantee real, not just the rewrite: "
"ext_proc holds the response at its headers until the buffered body has "
"been processed, so a backend ``201`` cannot reach the client before the "
"job is durably registered — which is what lets a failed registration "
"still answer ``503``."
msgstr ""
"Buffered 不仅服务于改写，也让创建保证真正成立：ext_proc 在缓冲正文处理完之前把响应停在响应头阶段，因此后端 ``201`` "
"不能在任务被持久登记之前到达客户端——这样登记失败时仍能返回 ``503``。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:282
msgid ""
"The mode has to come from that route's configuration. The pinned Envoy "
"Gateway (v1.2.8) has no ``allowModeOverride`` field on "
"``EnvoyExtensionPolicy`` and never sets ext_proc's "
"``allow_mode_override``, so a per-request ``ModeOverride`` from the "
"gateway plugin would be silently ignored; do not add such a field on that"
" version."
msgstr ""
"该模式必须来自那条路由的配置。当前固定的 Envoy Gateway（v1.2.8）在 ``EnvoyExtensionPolicy`` 上没有 "
"``allowModeOverride`` 字段，也从不设置 ext_proc 的 "
"``allow_mode_override``，因此网关插件发出的按请求 ``ModeOverride`` "
"会被静默忽略；不要在该版本上添加此字段。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:284
msgid ""
"Route selection happens twice per request, and both passes matter. The "
"gateway pins a request by answering with ``routing-strategy``/``target-"
"pod`` headers and clearing Envoy's route cache, so the request re-matches"
" the ``EnvoyPatchPolicy`` pinning routes in "
"``config/gateway/gateway.yaml`` before it leaves for the pod — and the "
"route picked on that second pass is the one Envoy uses for the response. "
"Those pinning routes therefore come in three flavours, one per Videos "
"route family, each enabling the same ext_proc filter its path route did. "
"A single catch-all pinning route would hand every pinned Videos response "
"to the shared, streamed filter, which both loses the buffering and "
"delivers the response to the plugin as a second stream with no request "
"context."
msgstr ""
"每条请求的路由选择会发生两次，两次都重要。网关通过返回 ``routing-strategy``/``target-pod`` 头并清除 "
"Envoy 的路由缓存来钉住请求，因此请求在发往 Pod 之前会重新匹配 ``config/gateway/gateway.yaml`` 中 "
"``EnvoyPatchPolicy`` 的钉住路由——第二次选中的路由才是 Envoy 用于响应的路由。因此这些钉住路由有三种形态，每种对应一个"
" Videos 路由族，各自启用与其路径路由相同的 ext_proc 过滤器。若只用一条通配钉住路由，所有被钉住的 Videos "
"响应都会交给共享的流式过滤器，既失去缓冲，又会把响应作为没有请求上下文的第二段流交给插件。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:286
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The two endpoints whose bodies must never be buffered — "
"``/v1/videos/sync`` and ``/v1/videos/{id}/content`` — are matched "
"separately by ``aibrix-reserved-router-videos-streaming`` (an ``Exact`` "
"and a ``RegularExpression`` match, both of which outrank the "
"``PathPrefix`` ``/v1/videos`` route in Envoy Gateway's match ordering) "
"and keep ``response.body: Streamed``. Neither carries a job ID to "
"rewrite. The shared ``aibrix-reserved-router`` also stays ``Streamed``, "
"because SSE completions have to be forwarded chunk by chunk."
msgstr ""
"绝不能缓冲正文的两个端点——``/v1/videos/sync`` 和 ``/v1/videos/{id}/content``——由 "
"``aibrix-reserved-router-videos-streaming`` 单独匹配（``Exact`` 和 "
"``RegularExpression``，在 Envoy Gateway 的匹配顺序中都高于 ``PathPrefix`` "
"``/v1/videos`` 路由），并保持 ``response.body: Streamed``。两者都不携带需要改写的任务 ID。共享的 "
"``aibrix-reserved-router`` 也保持 ``Streamed``，因为 SSE completion 必须按分片转发。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-video.rst:288
msgid "**Pod takes a long time to become ready**"
msgstr "**Pod 就绪耗时很长**"

